.TH NN-COMPUTE 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-compute \- estimate MACs and FLOPs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn compute [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Static compute estimates from shapes and operators. Unknown ops are counted separately.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-per\-node
Per-node costs.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn compute model.onnx
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-ops(1), nn-memory(1)
